    "name": "Second Shift",
    "steam_appid": 3042860,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/999b44186e7d776951338c800c4649cb.avif?t=1751849997\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SECOND SHIFT</strong> is a first-person horror game that immerses players in a deep and intense atmosphere. Using a mysterious clock, uncover terrifying secrets while trying to escape the mine. Solve puzzles, pay attention to details, and most importantly\u2014survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/5f9d4cdc8fa1c1c6bf3080bff7a778c6.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/5f9d4cdc8fa1c1c6bf3080bff7a778c6.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his journalist wife dies in a suspicious accident, Owen Miller infiltrates a secret mining operation to take revenge on the dark corporation ZitanovaTech. He finds the ancient watch they\u2019re searching for\u2014but the watch does more than guide him. It unleashes a deadly entity. As Owen fights to survive, he begins to uncover both the truth behind his wife's death and the company's darkest secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If danger approaches, shine the light directly on it. It may move away... maybe.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/bdd63b6815a3438f6cfa834c2fe1d547.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/bdd63b6815a3438f6cfa834c2fe1d547.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break, pass, move forward... But your shovel is weak \u2014 you can only break through 2 stones at most.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4074bd563582a5760d82ea7327a65ac5.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4074bd563582a5760d82ea7327a65ac5.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some things are invisible to the eye. But the light from the watch makes them visible.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/7f35b7448c0a4abd543eddd7be77fb6b.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/7f35b7448c0a4abd543eddd7be77fb6b.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This light not only reveals secrets but also illuminates your path. But use it carefully... There's a cooldown.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4c2ee90c7a2c1fc3effaf1136a934a4b.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4c2ee90c7a2c1fc3effaf1136a934a4b.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The watch senses approaching danger. If the red light turns on... Be prepared.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/dcedca5bdb39f7e8e5b24a7bdc1ded85.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/dcedca5bdb39f7e8e5b24a7bdc1ded85.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the terrifying creatures lurking in the depths of the dark mine. Prepare for the peak of fear!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/961e156b46d834f1d311ef4e744735ec.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/961e156b46d834f1d311ef4e744735ec.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/999b44186e7d776951338c800c4649cb.avif?t=1751849997\" data-has-big width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SECOND SHIFT</strong> is a first-person horror game that immerses players in a deep and intense atmosphere. Using a mysterious clock, uncover terrifying secrets while trying to escape the mine. Solve puzzles, pay attention to details, and most importantly\u2014survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/5f9d4cdc8fa1c1c6bf3080bff7a778c6.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/5f9d4cdc8fa1c1c6bf3080bff7a778c6.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his journalist wife dies in a suspicious accident, Owen Miller infiltrates a secret mining operation to take revenge on the dark corporation ZitanovaTech. He finds the ancient watch they\u2019re searching for\u2014but the watch does more than guide him. It unleashes a deadly entity. As Owen fights to survive, he begins to uncover both the truth behind his wife's death and the company's darkest secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If danger approaches, shine the light directly on it. It may move away... maybe.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/bdd63b6815a3438f6cfa834c2fe1d547.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/bdd63b6815a3438f6cfa834c2fe1d547.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break, pass, move forward... But your shovel is weak \u2014 you can only break through 2 stones at most.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4074bd563582a5760d82ea7327a65ac5.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/4074bd563582a5760d82ea7327a65ac5.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some things are invisible to the eye. But the light from the watch makes them visible.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/7f35b7448c0a4abd543eddd7be77fb6b.poster.avif?t=1751849997\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3042860/extras/7f35b7448c0a4abd543eddd7be77fb6b.webm?t=1751849997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This light not only reveals secrets but also illuminates your path. But use it carefully... There's a cooldown.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\